  message: "Investigated 2026-06-01 for cluster context. Parent set to INV-kurup (P2 violated, META: identifier-bearing fields emit non-canonical formats). WI-vodin closes the static-enforcement gap named in ADR-0034 §'Enforcement' — the runtime spec-validator catches malformed IDs after the pipeline runs, but no source-level check flags Symbol(id=f'...') patterns at PR-review or commit time. Also extends the runtime spec-validator to scan Edge.id (Phase 6 PR1 deferred item). Parallel-in-shape to multi_value_field_axis.py for the id-construction discipline. Sibling of WI-bupim (stable_id uniqueness residuals) under the larger identity-axes cluster. Doesn't duplicate any preexisting row — it's the static-enforcement face of INV-kurup."  # e21b
