  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0036, merged in PR #4181): the linter/validator now has a concrete target grammar — anchored 5-slot node.id, colon-free lang/span/name/kind, colon-tolerant path, parse from both ends, kind slot == node.kind, enumerated sentinels. Implement the static-AST linter and Edge.id schema-validator extension against that grammar once the ADR PR merges."  # 1bf9
